---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="InTellMe"
  description="InTellMe is a research and software company in Johnson City, Tennessee. The live products and company details are listed on this page."
  path="/"
>

  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-line">
    <picture>
      <source media="(max-width: 1023px)" srcset="/assets/imagery/hero-globe-1400.webp" />
      <img class="hero__still" src="/assets/imagery/hero-globe.webp" alt=""
           width="2400" height="1350" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
    </picture>
    <div class="hero__veil" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="suite suite--flagship hero__inner">
      <h1 class="hero-line" id="hero-line">A research and software company in Johnson City, Tennessee.</h1>
      <hr class="rule--champagne" />
      <p class="hero-support">Founder-run. TruVector is the checkpoint an AI system runs before it acts. The rest of this page is the live work &mdash; each product has its own site.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="#work">See the work</a>
        <a class="btn btn--secondary" href="#company">Company</a>
        <a class="btn btn--tertiary" href="#contact">Contact <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="room" id="work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
    <div class="suite suite--flagship">
      <p class="kicker">Work</p>
      <h2 class="suite-title reveal" id="work-title">Live products and the science behind them.</h2>
      <p class="lede reveal" style="margin-top:22px;max-width:66ch">Each one has its own site. This page is the index.</p>

      <div class="rooms" style="margin-top:48px">
        <article class="product reveal">
          <div class="product__meta">
            <h3 class="product__mark--typeset" style="margin:0">Lane Vector</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="product__body">The science of how information moves.</p>
          <div class="product__action">
            <a class="btn btn--tertiary" href="https://www.lanevector.com" rel="noopener">Open Lane Vector <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="product reveal">
          <div class="product__meta">
            <h3 class="product__mark--typeset" style="margin:0">TruVector</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="product__body">A checkpoint an AI system runs before it acts.</p>
          <div class="product__action">
            <a class="btn btn--tertiary" href="https://truvector.science" rel="noopener">Open TruVector <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="product reveal">
          <img class="product__lockup" src="/assets/logos/researchone.svg" width="72" height="72" alt="" />
          <div class="product__meta">
            <h3 class="visually-hidden">ResearchOne</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="product__body">A multi-agent research system that maps a question across sources, tests its own conclusions, and keeps contradictions in the report.</p>
          <div class="product__action">
            <a class="btn btn--tertiary" href="https://www.researchone.io/" rel="noopener">Open ResearchOne <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="product reveal">
          <img class="product__lockup" src="/assets/logos/savr.png"
               srcset="/assets/logos/savr.png 1x, /assets/logos/savr@2x.png 2x, /assets/logos/savr@3x.png 3x"
               width="163" height="72" alt="" />
          <div class="product__meta">
            <h3 class="visually-hidden">SAVR</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="product__body">Kitchen inventory and recipe planning from what you already have.</p>
          <div class="product__action">
            <a class="btn btn--tertiary" href="https://savr.cam" rel="noopener">Visit SAVR <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="product reveal">
          <img class="product__lockup" src="/assets/logos/waether.png"
               srcset="/assets/logos/waether.png 1x, /assets/logos/waether@2x.png 2x, /assets/logos/waether@3x.png 3x"
               width="72" height="72" alt="" />
          <div class="product__meta">
            <h3 class="visually-hidden">wAether</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="product__body">Observatory of solar, galactic, and terrestrial telemetry from named government sources.</p>
          <div class="product__action">
            <a class="btn btn--tertiary" href="https://www.waether.space" rel="noopener">Open wAether <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="product reveal">
          <img class="product__lockup" src="/assets/logos/golden-goose-tools.png"
               srcset="/assets/logos/golden-goose-tools.png 1x, /assets/logos/golden-goose-tools@2x.png 2x, /assets/logos/golden-goose-tools@3x.png 3x"
               width="107" height="72" alt="" />
          <div class="product__meta">
            <h3 class="visually-hidden">Golden Goose Tools</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="product__body">Small tools you buy and keep. An InTellMe studio. BugNote, a technical SEO audit, and an accessibility check are live.</p>
          <div class="product__action">
            <a class="btn btn--tertiary" href="https://www.goldengoosetools.com/" rel="noopener">Open Golden Goose Tools <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="product reveal">
          <img class="product__lockup" src="/assets/logos/golden-goose-tees.png"
               srcset="/assets/logos/golden-goose-tees.png 1x, /assets/logos/golden-goose-tees@2x.png 2x, /assets/logos/golden-goose-tees@3x.png 3x"
               width="84" height="72" alt="" />
          <div class="product__meta">
            <h3 class="visually-hidden">Golden Goose Tees Studio</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="product__body">Design a shirt, see it on a mockup, and order it printed and shipped.</p>
          <div class="product__action">
            <a class="btn btn--tertiary" href="https://www.goldengoosetees.com/" rel="noopener">Open Golden Goose Tees <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="product reveal">
          <div class="product__meta">
            <h3 class="product__mark--typeset" style="margin:0">NewJobBio</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="product__body">Retells work you actually did in the language of the job posting. Nothing invented.</p>
          <div class="product__action">
            <a class="btn btn--tertiary" href="https://www.newjobbio.com" rel="noopener">Open NewJobBio <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="product reveal">
          <div class="product__meta">
            <h3 class="product__mark--typeset" style="margin:0">yoohoo.guru</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="product__body">Local help from neighbors in Johnson City. Escrow and two-sided reviews.</p>
          <div class="product__action">
            <a class="btn btn--tertiary" href="https://www.yoohoo.guru" rel="noopener">Open yoohoo.guru <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="room room--alt" id="company" aria-labelledby="company-title">
    <div class="suite suite--flagship">
      <p class="kicker">Company</p>
      <h2 class="suite-title reveal" id="company-title">Built and run by Michael Brandon Lane.</h2>

      <div class="founder reveal">
        <p class="lede">InTellMe is an independent research and software company founded and operated by Michael Brandon Lane, a chemical engineer and chemist based in Johnson City, Tennessee.</p>

        <p>Before InTellMe, Lane worked at Celgard on lithium-ion battery separator and coating technology, including the development and scale-up of coated separator systems for high-volume manufacturing. He is a named inventor on multiple Celgard patents covering coated battery separators, including <a href="https://patents.google.com/patent/US11949124B2/en" rel="noopener">U.S. Patent 11,949,124</a>.</p>

        <p>That work shaped how he builds software: every number should trace back to a measurement, uncertainty should be stated out loud, and conclusions should change when the data does.</p>

        <p>Lane Vector applies the same kind of measurement to how information moves. TruVector puts one result of that work in front of an AI action. The other products on this page are separate sites, each written for its own job.</p>

        <p>InTellMe is self-funded and founder-run.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="room" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
    <div class="suite suite--flagship">
      <p class="kicker">Contact</p>
      <h2 class="suite-title reveal" id="contact-title">Reach the person doing the work.</h2>

      <div class="contact reveal">
        <div class="contact__primary">
          <p class="contact__name">InTellMe</p>
          <address class="contact__address">
            326 Delaware Street<br />
            Johnson City, TN 37604<br />
            United States
          </address>
          <ul class="contact__lines">
            <li><span class="contact__label">Telephone</span><a href="tel:+17473221977">(747) 322-1977</a></li>
            <li><span class="contact__label">General</span><a href="mailto:info@intellmeai.com">info@intellmeai.com</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="contact__directory">
          <div class="contact__col">
            <h3>Support</h3>
            <ul>
              <li><a href="mailto:support@intellmeai.com">support@intellmeai.com</a></li>
              <li><a href="mailto:billing@intellmeai.com">billing@intellmeai.com</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="contact__col">
            <h3>Security</h3>
            <ul>
              <li><a href="mailto:security@intellmeai.com">security@intellmeai.com</a></li>
              <li><a href="/.well-known/security.txt">security.txt</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="contact__col">
            <h3>Accessibility</h3>
            <ul>
              <li><a href="/accessibility">Accessibility statement</a></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
